{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7536988618849","title":"Black Bow Mommy and Me Set - Tie-Neck Top & Skirt","handle":"black-bow-mommy-and-me-set","status":"ACTIVE","publishedAt":"2026-04-24T14:26:06Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/black-bow-mommy-and-me-set","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven fabric with a softly crinkled texture and an airy drape for warm-weather matching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A polished black mom-and-daughter look made for vacations, birthday photos, city strolls, and easy summer afternoons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"Black Bow\" is a solid black set with a bow-style tie neckline, soft drape, and a flouncy mini skirt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Sleeveless tie-neck top, softly gathered neckline, relaxed peplum-style hem, elastic-waist skirt, and easy movement through every step and twirl.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and use a cool iron on the reverse if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 2 Years to Child 9-10 Years; Mother S to Mother L.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Top &amp; Skirt Set</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Sleeve or Skirt (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>12-14.5 kg / 26.5-32.0 lbs</td>\n<td>86-95 cm / 33.9-37.4 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n<td>32 cm / 12.6 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3 in</td>\n<td>37 cm / 14.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>15-17.5 kg / 33.1-38.6 lbs</td>\n<td>96-105 cm / 37.8-41.3 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>34 cm / 13.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>46 cm / 18.1 in</td>\n<td>40 cm / 15.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>18-20 kg / 39.7-44.1 lbs</td>\n<td>106-115 cm / 41.7-45.3 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>36 cm / 14.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>48 cm / 18.9 in</td>\n<td>43 cm / 16.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>20.5-22.5 kg / 45.2-49.6 lbs</td>\n<td>116-125 cm / 45.7-49.2 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>38 cm / 15.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>50 cm / 19.7 in</td>\n<td>46 cm / 18.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>23-25 kg / 50.7-55.1 lbs</td>\n<td>126-135 cm / 49.6-53.1 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>40 cm / 15.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n<td>49 cm / 19.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>25.5-30 kg / 56.2-66.1 lbs</td>\n<td>136-145 cm / 53.5-57.1 in</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>42 cm / 16.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>30.5-40 kg / 67.2-88.2 lbs</td>\n<td>145-155 cm / 57.1-61.0 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22.0 in</td>\n<td>55 cm / 21.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>47.5-57.5 kg / 104.7-126.8 lbs</td>\n<td>155-165 cm / 61.0-65.0 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>41 cm / 16.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>61 cm / 24.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>58-62.5 kg / 127.9-137.8 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>42 cm / 16.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>60 cm / 23.6 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>63-69.5 kg / 138.9-153.2 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 65.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>43 cm / 16.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Black Bow Mommy and Me Set brings a polished boutique feel to matching-moment dressing. The sleeveless tie-neck top skims softly away from the body, while the flouncy skirt adds movement that feels polished enough for family photos and relaxed enough for all-day summer plans.</p>\n\n<p>From cafe strolls to birthday lunches and travel snapshots, this two-piece look keeps styling simple without losing that dressed-up charm. The solid black tone feels classic and elevated, and the top-and-skirt pairing makes the outfit feel airy, twirl-friendly, and easy to accessorize with sandals, bows, and woven bags.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Airy two-piece silhouette:</strong> The sleeveless top and flouncy skirt feel light, comfortable, and warm-weather ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tie-neck detail:</strong> Long front ties create the bow-inspired neckline shown in the supplied photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flouncy skirt:</strong> A short layered skirt adds movement and a photo-ready finish for vacations and special outings.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy elastic waist:</strong> The skirt waistband helps keep the fit comfortable for both mom and mini.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini coordination:</strong> Both roles share the same elegant black outfit story for effortless twinning.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home a black mommy-and-me set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Black","Bow Neck","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dresses","Flouncy Skirt","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1044368546950.html","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Matching Family Outfi